## Interface: 16001
## Title: Gamepad Enhancer
## Notes: Customizes the controller's action bars. Hides them out of combat but for the shoulder icons, faded while you have a target or hold a trigger or bumper, more in range. Fades the shoulder icons out of combat. Settings in Options > AddOns > Gamepad Enhancer, or /gpen.
